## 🧠 Semantic Understanding

<a id="intent-1-publish-the-existing-new-relic-management-surfac"></a>
### 1. Publish the existing New Relic management surface as stable 2026-06-01 and preserve the released Go delete method parameter order.

| Change | Aspect | Before | After |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| ✏️ Modified | API-version availability | The service surface is available only as 2025-05-01-preview. | The same 35-operation surface is also available as stable 2026-06-01. |
| ✏️ Modified | generated client API-version default | Generated clients default to 2025-05-01-preview. | Generated clients default to 2026-06-01. |
| ✏️ Modified | Go Monitors_Delete parameter order | The stable generation would use the default TypeSpec parameter order. | A Go-scoped override preserves the released apiVersion, subscriptionId, resourceGroupName, provider, userEmail, monitorName order. |

**TypeSpec change:** Append `v2026_06_01` to `Versions` and apply a Go-only `@@override` for `NewRelicMonitorResources.delete`.

```diff
--- a/specification/newrelic/NewRelicObservability.Management/client.tsp
+++ b/specification/newrelic/NewRelicObservability.Management/client.tsp
@@ -319,3 +321,34 @@ namespace Azure.ResourceManager.Models {
 ... 22 earlier diff lines omitted; full hunk is in assessment.json ...
+  /**
+   * Name of the Monitors resource.
+   */
+  @path
+  monitorName: string,
+): void;
+
+@@override(
+  NewRelicMonitorResources.delete,
+  newRelicMonitorResourceDelete,
+  "go"
+);
```

```diff
--- a/specification/newrelic/NewRelicObservability.Management/main.tsp
+++ b/specification/newrelic/NewRelicObservability.Management/main.tsp
@@ -40,6 +40,11 @@ enum Versions {
    * The 2025-05-01-preview API version.
    */
   v2025_05_01_preview: "2025-05-01-preview",
+
+  /**
+   * The 2026-06-01 API version.
+   */
+  v2026_06_01: "2026-06-01",
 }

 interface Operations extends Azure.ResourceManager.Operations {}
```

**Impact:** [The stable version retains the replaced preview version](#finding-compliance-44882-stable-after-preview)<br>
**Source:** [main.tsp:L43-L47](https://github.com/Azure/azure-rest-api-specs/blob/22bc88578fb1f253688e8a5bf127ef3a4502745a/specification/newrelic/NewRelicObservability.Management/main.tsp#L43-L47), [client.tsp:L321-L354](https://github.com/Azure/azure-rest-api-specs/blob/22bc88578fb1f253688e8a5bf127ef3a4502745a/specification/newrelic/NewRelicObservability.Management/client.tsp#L321-L354)

